.TH "transmission-remote-gtk" "1" "" "1.7.1" "Transmission Remote GTK"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
transmission-remote-gtk \- RPC client for the Transmission BitTorrent client, written in GTK.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.nf
\fBtransmission\-remote\-gtk\fP [OPTIONS] [torrent file|magnet link|url]
.fi
.sp
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
\fBtransmission\-remote\-gtk\fP is an application for remote management of the
Transmission BitTorrent client using its RPC interface.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.sp
\fBtransmission\-remote\-gtk\fP has no options, but torrent files, magnet links,
or URLs may be passed to the command to be automatically loaded. For example:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
transmission\-remote\-gtk Downloads/ubuntu\-22.04.3\-desktop\-amd64.iso.torrent
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SH "محیط (ENVIRONMENT)"
.sp
The following environment variables an be used when running \fBtransmission\-remote\-gtk\fP
.sp
\fBTRG_CLIENT_DEBUG\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
When this environment is set, verbose HTTP and JSON information will be logged to stdout
for debugging purposes. Be aware that this can be extremely verbose.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
.sp
Written by Alan Fitton.
.sp
Maintained by various contributors.
.SH "اشکالات (BUGS)"
.sp
